-tubulin acetylation and antifungal immune response (PubMed:34301894). Also acts as a positive regulator of cGAS-STING signaling by promoting plasma membrane localization of CGAS: following phosphorylation by SYK, acts as an molecular adapter by recruiting KAT2A to CGAS at the plasma membrane, leading to CGAS acetylation and activation (PubMed:39694035)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}